      "summary": "Amnesty International documented cases of torture and degrading treatment by Spanish military personnel against migrants in Ceuta. The Defence Ministry has forwarded Amnesty’s findings to the Public Prosecutor’s Office and initiated an internal investigation, saying it acted to preserve the good name of the Armed Forces. Reports agree the matter involves alleged ill-treatment of migrants by military members in Ceuta and that authorities have taken the case to the judiciary."
